1
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,240
If that doesn't work,

2
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,560
try another way.

3
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,660
I'm just afraid there is no other way.

4
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,360
There is,

5
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:21,920
but it's

6
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,600
even more dangerous.

7
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,560
Don't worry,

8
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,240
as soon as Lord Zhou's letter arrives,

9
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:32,240
I'll let you know immediately.

10
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:36,570
Okay.

11
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:38,160
Thank you.

12
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,600
Why didn't we travel with the Daoist priest and the others?

13
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,400
A large group is easily exposed.

14
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:48,880
What about Brother Chaijiu and the old man?

15
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,680
They went ahead to scout the way.

16
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:59,000
Breaking heads and spilling food,

17
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:02,880
makes a good world.

18
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,640
Three thousand strings of coins gets you into the Secret Pavilion.

19
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:10,440
Five hundred strings of coins promotes you to controller-general.

20
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,280
On a perfectly good Shangyuan Festival,

21
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,940
they sing rhymes mocking high court officials.

22
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,530
They must have a death wish.

23
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:24,960
This nursery rhyme is sung in every street and alley.

24
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,690
You cannot stop it, Lord Duzhi.

25
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,400
It was the same in Wuyou City.

26
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,760
Those in high positions only need a single thought,

27
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,800
and below, blood flows like rivers and corpses pile like mountains.

28
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,800
Watch your words.

29
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,280
Brother.

30
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,210
How is it?

31
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,320
I asked around.

32
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,520
Around late last night,

33
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,680
rumors started spreading everywhere

34
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,040
that the Master of Wuyou Cave is dead.

35
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,920
Now, various factions inside and outside Wuyou City

36
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,450
are all itching for action.

37
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,120
Is he...

38
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,850
really dead?

39
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,400
Why do you say

40
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,760
he's really dead?

41
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,920
Given the situation,

42
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:17,850
just spit it out.

43
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,680
Yesterday,

44
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,680
we were scouting out the West Water Gate Dock

45
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,940
and ran into Liu Heizi,

46
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,640
my loafer companion.

47
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,960
He said he was guiding a gang of thieves.

48
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,720
Moreover,

49
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:31,480
he sold the information that the Master of Wuyou Cave wanted to go to the dock.

50
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,520
That big battle at the West Water Gate Dock last night

51
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,050
was probably those thieves

52
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,520
attacking the Master of Wuyou Cave.

53
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:40,040
I felt the Master of Wuyou Cave was very powerful,

54
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:42,170
so I didn't take it seriously at first.

55
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,370
Impossible.

56
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,079
Absolutely impossible.

57
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:47,960
Based on my more than ten years in Wuyou City

58
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:50,320
dealing with the Master of Wuyou Cave,

59
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:51,920
thinking that just one brawl

60
00:03:52,079 --> 00:03:53,200
and a gang of thieves

61
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,260
could take his life

62
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:56,160
is simply a fool's dream.

63
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:59,320
Then how do you explain the current rumors and

64
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,300
the infighting in Wuyou City?

65
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,320
Did something really happen

66
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,760
to Cave Master Wuyou?

67
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,600
Hearing is deceiving,

68
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,800
seeing is believing.

69
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,730
Let's verify it ourselves.

70
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,520
Then please go and return quickly

71
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,920
to avoid complications.

72
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,100
Your Excellency Cave Master,

73
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,440
our task is complete.

74
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:28,120
We've come to collect our reward.

75
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:31,560
Wuyou City is in chaos now,

76
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,320
yet you still risked your lives to come.

77
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:36,540
Never mind.

78
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,880
As for this military defense map,

79
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,040
just take it.

80
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,240
How can I confirm

81
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,840
that your map is real?

82
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,159
If you don't believe me, Daoist,

83
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:50,320
then I can't do anything about it.

84
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,520
This is the wrong way.

85
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,980
I sense murderous intent.

86
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:10,970
First of all,

87
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,200
do you resent me that much?

88
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,600
Do you still remember

89
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,170
that your courtesy name, Shouxin,

90
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,160
was given by me?

91
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,520
In this dynasty, the Crown Prince's duty

92
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:28,040
is merely to ask after the Emperor's well-being and meals.

93
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:31,240
Every day, there is almost nothing to do but pay respects.

94
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:34,040
When I saw you lack ambition,

95
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,640
I wished you could do better,

96
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:38,280
which is why I was so strict with you.

97
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:41,360
Is that why you resent me?

98
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,040
Wish I could do better?

99
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,320
If I truly lacked ambition,

100
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,200
how could I own Wuyou City

101
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,400
and become its ruler?

102
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,600
How could I

103
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,490
resist against your Knife Lenders

104
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,120
for so many years?

105
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,360
You did all this

106
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,680
to kill the Emperor.

107
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,560
Aunt,

108
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,810
you were looking for me?

109
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:45,520
You'll accompany me to Fanlou tonight.

110
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,860
You need to dress appropriately.

111
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,159
Madame Li

112
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,000
has helped our Zhao family.

113
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,880
Tonight is for paying our respects

114
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:55,740
and showing our gratitude to her.

115
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,400
Grateful?

116
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,480
Why

117
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:01,840
was it me?

118
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,380
About your royal decree of marriage.

119
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:07,010
If Shishi hadn't mentioned it to the Emperor,

120
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:09,810
he wouldn't have remembered the Zhao family,

121
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,200
let alone

122
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,840
notice you.

123
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,800
Auntie, you should know

124
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,360
that I have great ambitions.

125
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,200
I hope to be like you,

126
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,100
famous all over the world,

127
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,610
instead of being trapped in the house.

128
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:26,760
I only found out

129
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,920
about this later.

130
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,400
Han'er.

131
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,200
For the Zhao family

132
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,880
to rise again,

133
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,440
sacrifices must be made.

134
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,520
So,

135
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,600
I am the sacrifice.

136
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:46,840
Han'er.

137
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:50,290
The Emperor's order cannot be disobeyed.

138
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,440
I know I was wrong.

139
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,330
Please don't blame me, Auntie.

140
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,720
I know

141
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:06,380
you are talented, Han'er.

142
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,260
But when you meet Miss Li tonight,

143
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,960
don't steal her thunder.

144
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,200
Just behave

145
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,160
appropriately.

146
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,170
Understood?

147
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,080
Yes.
